{"id":"n62772-1-16","stage":3,"title":"상영 · 上映","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62772-1-16-1","ko":"지금이 한 시니까, 영화가 끝나면 네 시쯤 될 거야.","zh":"现在是一点钟，等电影看完的话，大概会到四点左右。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금이","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금이","audio":"/audio/e32bcbbecd9f3516ea6f.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一","explanation":"한：一","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"시니까,","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시니까","audio":"/audio/f72f4ad28aa1886b4392.mp3"}},{"text":"영화가","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화가","audio":"/audio/71d36dbc5cb7f78071bd.mp3"}},{"text":"끝나면","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝나면","audio":"/audio/dd2759215203be9a62c1.mp3"}},{"text":"네","meaning":"四","explanation":"네：四","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64556","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"시쯤","meaning":"点，点钟","explanation":"시：点，点钟；쯤：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"시","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65108","senseId":"1","lemma":"시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시쯤","audio":"/audio/5cee0200714717de27f5.mp3"}},{"text":"될","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"될","audio":"/audio/dc84eeabbbd47f74f20a.mp3"}},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"一","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"bfa42cf6a12e9123","term":"시","zh":"点，点钟","audio":"/audio/bfa42cf6a12e91233038.mp3","entryId":"65108","definition":"计时单位，表示一天二十四小时中的某一个。","pronunciation":["시"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"事情做完。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"四","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"64556","definition":"四的。","pronunciation":["네ː"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/00805f2e4579208fdac5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62772-1-16-2","ko":"상영 시간이 세 시간이나 돼?","zh":"放映时间有三个小时那么长吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"상영","meaning":"上映","explanation":"상영：上映","readings":[{"term":"상영","audio":"/audio/58467cd034957ba649c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62772","senseId":"1","lemma":"상영","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상영","audio":"/audio/58467cd034957ba649c4.mp3"}},{"text":"시간이","meaning":"小时","explanation":"시간：小时；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62842","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이","audio":"/audio/cecaa2f0353f97459090.mp3"}},{"text":"세","meaning":"三","explanation":"세：三","readings":[{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17194","senseId":"1","lemma":"세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}},{"text":"시간이나","meaning":"小时","explanation":"시간：小时；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62842","senseId":"1","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간이나","audio":"/audio/04eba400474fee59a4d7.mp3"}},{"text":"돼?","meaning":"有","explanation":"되다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"4","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL